{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45637","headline":"书陈处士屋壁二首 二 · 贯休","name":"书陈处士屋壁二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高步前山前，高歌北山北。\n数载卖甘橙，山赀近云足。\n新诗不将出，往往僧乞得。\n唯云李太白，亦是偷桃贼。\n吟狂鬼神走，酒酽天地[黑]。\n青刍生堦除，撷之束成束。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45637.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45637","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}